Usage: tk config set <KEY> <VALUE>

Arguments:
  <KEY>    project | priority | labels | clean-after
  <VALUE>  New value ("off" disables clean-after; an empty labels list clears
           them)

Flags:
  -h, --help             Print help

Global flags:
