=== tk config project rename ===
Rename a project in every task that uses it

A project is a display field, so this changes one field per task and rewrites no
references.

Usage: tk config project rename <OLD> <NEW>

Arguments:
  <OLD>  Current project name
  <NEW>  New project name

Flags:
  -h, --help             Print help

Global flags:
  -j, --json             Output as JSON
  -C, --dir <DIR>        Run in a different directory
      --tasks-dir <DIR>  Task store directory: exact path, must already exist
                         (no discovery)
